-- title:
--   Cusp count for Γ_H(q²M') with H=ker to (ℤ/q)^×
-- statement:
--   Let $q$ be a prime with $3 \le q$ and let $M'$ be a nonzero natural number with $q \nmid M'$. Write $H = \mathtt{levelH}\,q\,M'$ for the kernel of the reduction homomorphism $(\mathbb{Z}/q^2M')^\times \to (\mathbb{Z}/q)^\times$, and let $\Gamma_H = \mathtt{CohCarrier.GammaH}\,(q^2M')\,H$ be the subgroup of $\mathrm{SL}_2(\mathbb{Z})$ obtained as the image, under the inclusion of $\Gamma_0(q^2M')$, of the preimage of $H$ under the homomorphism $\Gamma_0(q^2M') \to (\mathbb{Z}/q^2M')^\times$ sending a matrix to the class of its lower-right entry; concretely, $\Gamma_H$ consists of the matrices $\begin{pmatrix} a & b \\ c & d\end{pmatrix} \in \mathrm{SL}_2(\mathbb{Z})$ with $c \equiv 0 \pmod{q^2M'}$ and $d \equiv 1 \pmod q$. Let $V \le \mathrm{SL}_2(\mathbb{Z})$ be the subgroup generated by $T = \begin{pmatrix} 1 & 1 \\ 0 & 1\end{pmatrix}$ together with $-1$ (the join of the two cyclic subgroups $\langle T\rangle$ and $\langle -1\rangle$). The assertion is the identity of natural numbers
--   $$2 \cdot \#\bigl(\Gamma_H \backslash \mathrm{SL}_2(\mathbb{Z}) / V\bigr) = (q^2-1)\cdot \sum_{d \mid M'} \varphi\bigl(\gcd(d, M'/d)\bigr),$$
--   where the left-hand cardinality is that of the set of double cosets and the sum is $\mathtt{cuspCount}\,M'$, the subtraction being in $\mathbb{N}$.
--
--   The set of double cosets $\Gamma_H \backslash \mathrm{SL}_2(\mathbb{Z}) / \langle T, -1\rangle$ is the set of cusps of the modular curve attached to $\Gamma_H(q^2M')$, so the statement is the classical cusp count: over each of the $\mathtt{cuspCount}\,M'$ cusps of $X_0(M')$ there lie $(q^2-1)/2$ cusps, the equality being phrased with a factor $2$ to stay in $\mathbb{N}$. It feeds the genus computations [`ModularCurve.FullLevel.genusFF_fieldBar_eq`](thm.html#ModularCurve.FullLevel.genusFF_fieldBar_eq) and [`ModularCurve.FullLevel.genusFF_fieldBar_eq_of_eq_three`](thm.html#ModularCurve.FullLevel.genusFF_fieldBar_eq_of_eq_three).
-- source:
--   https://github.com/anthropics/fermats-last-theorem/blob/aa2d8b34692b16c70f699536de0d8e75b9a3e9ef/Theorems/Thm_ModularCurve_FullLevel_two_mul_natCard_doubleCoset_gammaH_levelH_zpowers_T_eq.lean

